==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Othom]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Maawth]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**10 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Having [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Awakened Ururun]] and [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] for the first wave of Relic Doges is enough to beat the stage. Using 4 meatshields is practically necessary: use a mix of slow and fast meatshields for the best effect.

